TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_JitterStreamBattery_I=Jitter Stream Battery I
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_JitterStreamBattery_I=Develop the Jitter Stream Battery I, a particle weapon designed to disrupt enemy targeting and effectively hit fast-moving targets with its unique jittering stream.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_JitterStreamBattery_II=Jitter Stream Battery II
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_JitterStreamBattery_II=An upgraded particle accelerator, the Jitter Stream Battery II delivers increased damage and targeting precision against diverse and heavily armored targets. Its adaptive firing pattern excels at tracking fast-moving enemies in space combat.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_JitterStreamBattery_III=Jitter Stream Battery III
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_JitterStreamBattery_III=Develop the Jitter Stream Battery III, a cutting-edge particle weapon delivering devastating damage to multiple targets, from fighters to capital ships. Its advanced acceleration and targeting systems provide unparalleled versatility and firepower in large-scale space battles.

TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk1=Plasmoid Streaker Battery Prototype - Mk I
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk1=Develop the Plasmoid Streaker Battery Mk I, a high-velocity energy weapon designed to deliver devastating damage to both small and large spacefaring targets. This prototype balances firing rate and impact force to enhance fleet offensive capabilities.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk2=Plasmoid Streaker Battery Prototype - Mk II
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk2=Develop the Plasmoid Streaker Battery Mk II, a powerful upgrade to the Mk I with enhanced plasmoid acceleration, improved targeting, and increased effectiveness against larger, faster targets. This advanced battery delivers a concentrated stream of high-velocity projectiles for superior space combat.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk3=Plasmoid Streaker Battery Prototype - Mk III
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk3=Develop the Mk III Plasmoid Streaker Battery, a high-velocity plasmoid weapon capable of devastating damage to multiple targets, enhancing fleet dominance in large-scale space battles.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk4=Plasmoid Streaker Battery Advanced Prototype - Mk IV
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk4=Develop the Plasmoid Streaker Battery Mk IV, a high-velocity weapon delivering devastating damage to multiple targets—from fighters to capital ships—with advanced plasmoid acceleration and targeting.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk5=Plasmoid Streaker Battery Advanced Prototype - Mk V
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk5=Develop the Mk V Plasmoid Streaker Battery, a high-velocity plasmoid weapon capable of devastating damage to multiple targets, enhancing fleet combat effectiveness.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk6=Plasmoid Streaker Battery Advanced Prototype - Mk VI
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk6=Develop the Mk VI Plasmoid Streaker Battery, a high-velocity plasmoid weapon capable of devastating damage to multiple targets, and a critical asset for dominating space combat.

TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_PhasedPlasmaCannon_Mk1=Phased Plasma Cannon Prototype - Mk I
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_PhasedPlasmaCannon_Mk1=Develop the Phased Plasma Cannon Mk I, a balanced energy weapon firing high-velocity plasma projectiles effective against fighters and larger ships. This prototype focuses on delivering devastating damage with a reliable rate of fire.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_PhasedPlasmaCannon_Mk2=Phased Plasma Cannon Prototype - Mk II
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_PhasedPlasmaCannon_Mk2=Develop the Mk II Phased Plasma Cannon, a significantly upgraded weapon with enhanced damage, targeting, and effectiveness against diverse and fortified targets. This prototype aims to deliver a critical advantage in space combat through concentrated, high-velocity plasma projectiles and adaptive firing patterns.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_PhasedPlasmaCannon_Mk3=Phased Plasma Cannon Prototype - Mk III
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_PhasedPlasmaCannon_Mk3=Develop the Mk III Phased Plasma Cannon, a powerful and versatile weapon capable of devastating multiple targets—from fighters to capital ships—with high-velocity plasma projectiles. Its advanced targeting and adaptive firing patterns make it a key asset in large-scale space battles.

TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_ProtoPlasmaArray_Mk1=Prototype Plasma Array Mk I
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_ProtoPlasmaArray_Mk1=Research and develop the Prototype Plasma Array Mk I, a powerful energy source utilizing controlled singularities for large-scale power generation and advanced technological support. This reactor is essential for establishing energy dominance in space.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_ProtoPlasmaArray_Mk2=Prototype Plasma Array Mk II
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_ProtoPlasmaArray_Mk2=Develop the Prototype Plasma Array Mk II, a next-generation power source boasting enhanced energy output, efficiency, and singularity control for large-scale space operations. This upgraded array is crucial for powering advanced technologies and achieving energy dominance.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_ProtoPlasmaArray_Mk3=Prototype Plasma Array Mk III
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_ProtoPlasmaArray_Mk3=Develop the Prototype Plasma Array Mk III, a high-output energy source utilizing cutting-edge singularity control for large-scale space operations and advanced technologies. This powerful array provides unparalleled energy efficiency and is crucial for achieving energy dominance.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_ProtoPlasmaArray_Mk4=Prototype Plasma Array Mk IV
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_ProtoPlasmaArray_Mk4=Develop the Prototype Plasma Array Mk IV, a next-generation power source utilizing advanced singularity control for increased energy output and efficiency in large-scale space operations. This array is crucial for powering advanced technologies and achieving energy dominance.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_ProtoPlasmaArray_Mk5=Prototype Plasma Array Mk V
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_ProtoPlasmaArray_Mk5=Research and develop the Prototype Plasma Array Mk V, a cutting-edge energy weapon offering unparalleled output and efficiency for large-scale space operations. This advanced technology utilizes singularity control for maximum power and stability.
