TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_ProtoPlasmaArray_Mk6=Research and develop the Prototype Plasma Array Mk VI, a cutting-edge energy weapon offering unparalleled output and efficiency for large-scale operations. This advanced technology utilizes singularity control to deliver superior power and establish energy dominance.

