TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_ProtoPlasmaCannon_Mk2=Develop the Prototype Plasma Cannon Mk II, a powerful upgrade to the Mk I with enhanced energy output and singularity control for large-scale space operations. This advanced weapon offers greater efficiency and stability, crucial for achieving energy dominance.
