TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_ProtoPlasmaCannon_Mk4=Develop the Prototype Plasma Cannon Mk IV, a powerful energy weapon utilizing advanced singularity control for superior output and efficiency in large-scale space operations. This upgrade to the Mk III delivers increased power and stability, crucial for achieving energy dominance.
