TIProjectTemplate.description.Project_2048cmBaseVioletLaserCannon=Develop the 2048cm Gigantic Base Violet Laser Cannon, a massive energy weapon specializing in high damage against capital ships and fortifications. This advanced laser utilizes violet laser technology for devastating firepower in large-scale space combat.
TIProjectTemplate.description.Project_4096cmBaseVioletLaserCannon=Research and build the 4096cm Gigantic Base Violet Laser Cannon, a colossal weapon designed to obliterate capital ships and fortified structures with devastating violet laser firepower.
TIProjectTemplate.description.Project_480cmIRArcLaserCannon_RapidFire=Develop a rapid-fire version of the 480cm IR Arc Laser Cannon to increase defensive firepower against agile threats.
